              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa mwĩao wa Yeova ana ma Isilaeli nĩmaendaa kyalo, na kwondũ wa mwĩao wa Yeova nĩmambaa maeema moo: o yĩla mũumbĩ wekalaa ĩũlũ wa wĩkalo mekalaa maeemani moo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
