          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla mũumbĩ wekalaa ĩũlũ wa wĩkalo mĩthenya mingĩ, nĩvo ĩndĩ ana ma Isilaeli masũvĩaa wĩaĩo wa Yeova, na matyaendaa kyalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mavinda amwe mũumbĩ waĩ ĩũlũ wa wĩkalo mĩthenya mĩvũthũ; na ĩndĩ kwĩanana na mwĩao wa Yeova nĩmekalaa maeemanĩ, moo, na kwĩanana na mwĩao wa Yeova nĩmaendaa kyalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mavinda amwe mũumbĩ waĩ vo kuma wĩoo kũvika kĩoko; na mũumbĩ wookĩlw’a kĩoko, nĩmaendaa kyalo: kana ethĩwa nĩwekalaa mũthenga na ũtukũ, o yĩla mũumbĩ wookĩlw’a, nĩmaendaa kyalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ethĩwa nĩ mĩthenya ĩlĩ, kana mwei, kana mwaka, mũumbĩ waũngama ĩũlũ wa wĩkalo, ũkĩkala ĩũlũ waw’o, ana ma Isilaeli nĩmekalaa maeemanĩ moo, na matyaendaa kyalo; ĩndĩ yĩla wookĩlw’a nĩmaendaa kyalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.22"
            ]
          }
